# Component Conventions

## Primitives to reach for first

| Need | Component | Import from |
|---|---|---|
| Page shell | `<Template topPad?>` | `src/ui/base/Template` |
| Content container | `<Section title? yPadding? className?>` | `src/ui/layout/Section` |
| CTA strip | `<Banner full? className?>` | `src/ui/features/Banner` |
| Branded button | `<ModernButton buttonVariant? size?>` | `src/ui/components/ModernButton` |
| Stat card | `<NumberDisplay text value icon?>` | `src/ui/components/NumberDisplay` |
| Two-col feature | `<VerticalFeatureRow title description image imageAlt reverse?>` | `src/ui/layout/VerticalFeatureRow` |
| WhatsApp CTA | `<WhatsAppButton eventType size? variant?>` | `src/ui/components/WhatsAppButton` |

## ModernButton variants

- `primary` — sage green gradient, white text (main CTAs)
- `secondary` — gold gradient, white text (secondary CTAs)
- `outline` — green border, green text (on light backgrounds)
- `outlineLight` — white border, white text (on dark/image backgrounds)
- `ghost` — no border, green text (tertiary actions)

For navigation links: `<ModernButton component={Link} href="/path" buttonVariant="primary">`.
Never wrap ModernButton in `<Link>` — use `component={Link}` directly.

## Brand palette

```
#7c9885   sage green — primary actions, icons
#9db5a0   sage green light — gradients
#c9a86c   warm gold — badges, secondary accents
bg-stone-50   page backgrounds
text-stone-800   primary text
text-stone-600   secondary/muted text
```

## Scroll animations

```tsx
import { AnimationOnScroll } from 'react-animation-on-scroll';

<AnimationOnScroll animateIn="animate__fadeIn" animateOnce>
  {/* content */}
</AnimationOnScroll>

// With staggered delay:
<AnimationOnScroll animateIn="animate__fadeInUp" delay={150} animateOnce>
```

Always set `animateOnce` — replaying animations on scroll-up is distracting.

## File placement

- Page sections → `src/ui/features/`
- Small atoms → `src/ui/components/`
- Layout wrappers → `src/ui/layout/`
- Site chrome → `src/ui/base/`
- Dialogs → `src/ui/modals/`

## Quality checklist

- [ ] All `<img>` have descriptive `alt`
- [ ] No `<a>` nested inside `<Link>`
- [ ] No inline `style={{}}` — prefer Tailwind utilities
- [ ] No hardcoded brand copy — use `AppConfig` or constants
- [ ] TypeScript types defined, no untyped `any`
